WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
PrivacyPilot: How a DPDP Act scan works

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Start a scan: Paste the repository URL, your privacy policy link and a GitHub token.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Live progress: The repository is downloaded, scanned in parallel chunks and compared with the policy.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.500
Results at a glance: Score, undisclosed data categories and an optional AI executive summary.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:27.000
Violations by provision: Each finding names the DPDP Act section and its severity.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Evidence and a fix: Open a finding to see the exact file and line, and what to change.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Every finding, filterable: Search all personal-data findings by category, origin and destination.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Run your first scan: Findings are indicators for legal review, not legal advice.

